message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "SaltCavern-PCC: A paired simulation benchmark for sonar salt-cavern point cloud completion"
authors:
  - name: "SaltCavern-PCC authors"
year: 2026
type: software
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/y694339607/SaltCavern-PCC"
repository-code: "https://github.com/y694339607/SaltCavern-PCC"
keywords:
  - point cloud completion
  - salt cavern gas storage
  - sonar surveying
  - structured missingness
  - decoupled geometry-volume evaluation
  - benchmark stability
abstract: >-
  Paired simulation benchmark (500 salt cavities x 3 observation-coverage tiers =
  1500 paired point cloud samples) with four composable sonar missingness
  mechanisms, an evaluation protocol separating geometric error from volume
  error (dual reference volumes, integrable-slice counting, three-way common
  support, input-matched no-completion baselines), and stability checks along
  initialization, data-order, and integration-configuration dimensions.
